<rml>
<head>
	<title>Jewel Bank (CJewelBankWindow)</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="base.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="docked_panel_frame.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="jewel_bank.rcss"/>
</head>
<body>
	<!-- The jewel bank of OpenMU (CJewelBankWindow), docked beside the inventory: the account's
	     stored jewels by number, one row per jewel the server accepts, each with Deposit (every
	     jewel of that kind in the inventory, single jewels and bundles) and Withdraw (an amount,
	     asked in the generic dialog), and Deposit all below. The workspace slot places and scales
	     #panel; everything inside is reference px; text is .sharp-text at the native size,
	     counter-scaled out of the panel. C++ keeps the received state, Escape and the requests;
	     clicks are queued with jewel_deposit(i), jewel_withdraw(i) and jewel_deposit_all. -->
	<div id="panel" data-model="jewel_bank">
		<div class="frame-piece frame-top"></div>
		<div class="frame-piece frame-left"></div>
		<div class="frame-piece frame-right"></div>
		<div class="frame-piece frame-bottom"></div>

		<span class="sharp-text sharp-centre" id="jb_title" data-style-font-size="bold_text_px + 'px'">{{title}}</span>
		<span class="sharp-text sharp-centre" id="jb_hint" data-style-font-size="text_px + 'px'">{{hint}}</span>

		<div id="jb_rows" data-if="available">
			<div class="jb-row" data-for="row : rows" data-class-stored="row.stored">
				<span class="sharp-text jb-name" data-style-font-size="text_px + 'px'">{{row.name}}</span>
				<span class="sharp-text sharp-right jb-amount" data-style-font-size="bold_text_px + 'px'">{{row.amount}}</span>
				<div class="jb-btn jb-deposit" data-event-click="jewel_deposit(row.index)" data-attr-data-hint="deposit_text">
					<span class="sharp-text sharp-centre sharp-middle jb-glyph" data-style-font-size="bold_text_px + 'px'">+</span>
				</div>
				<div class="jb-btn jb-withdraw" data-class-locked="!row.stored" data-event-click="jewel_withdraw(row.index)"
				     data-attr-data-hint="withdraw_text">
					<span class="sharp-text sharp-centre sharp-middle jb-glyph" data-style-font-size="bold_text_px + 'px'">-</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<span class="sharp-text sharp-centre" id="jb_unavailable" data-if="!available"
		      data-style-font-size="text_px + 'px'">{{unavailable_text}}</span>

		<div id="jb_deposit_all" class="jb-wide-btn" data-class-locked="!available" data-event-click="jewel_deposit_all">
			<span class="sharp-text sharp-centre sharp-middle jb-wide-label" data-style-font-size="bold_text_px + 'px'">{{deposit_all_text}}</span>
		</div>
		<div id="frame_corner_close" data-event-click="window_close"></div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
